  "content": "# Buttons\n\nProvide a variety of button, including customizable sizes and types.\n\n```astro\n---\nimport { ArrowUpRightIcon } from \"lucide-react\";\n---\n\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t<!-- A standard button -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled\">\n\t\tButton\n\t</button>\n\t<!-- A button + icon -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled\">\n\t\t<span>Button</span>\n\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t</button>\n\t<!-- An icon button -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t</button>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Sizes\n\nUse `btn-{size}` paired with: `xs|sm|base|lg|xl|2xl|3xl|4xl|5xl|6xl|7xl|8xl|9xl`\n\n```astro\n---\nimport { ArrowUpRightIcon, PlusIcon } from \"lucide-react\";\n---\n\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-4\">\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-xs preset-filled\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon btn-icon-xs preset-filled\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon />\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm preset-filled\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon btn-icon-sm preset-filled\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon />\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-base preset-filled\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button\n\t\t\ttype=\"button\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"btn-icon btn-icon-base preset-filled\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Go\"\n\t\t\taria-label=\"Go\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon />\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-lg preset-filled\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon btn-icon-lg preset-filled\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon />\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-xl preset-filled\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon btn-icon-xl preset-filled\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon />\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<!-- NOTE: 2x|3xl|4xl|5xl|6xl|7xl|8xl|9xl tructated for space -->\n\n\t<hr class=\"hr\" />\n\n\t<!-- Floating Action Buttons -->\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<!-- Shaped -->\n\t\t<button\n\t\t\ttype=\"button\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"btn-icon btn-icon-2xl preset-filled\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Go\"\n\t\t\taria-label=\"Go\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t<PlusIcon />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<!-- Circular -->\n\t\t<button\n\t\t\ttype=\"button\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"btn-icon btn-icon-2xl preset-filled rounded-full\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Go\"\n\t\t\taria-label=\"Go\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t<PlusIcon />\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Disabled\n\nWhen applied to a `<button>` element you can use the `disabled` attribute.\n\n```astro\n---\nimport { ArrowUpRightIcon } from \"lucide-react\";\n---\n\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t<!-- A standard button -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled\" disabled>\n\t\tButton\n\t</button>\n\t<!-- A button + icon -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled\" disabled>\n\t\t<span>Button</span>\n\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t</button>\n\t<!-- An icon button -->\n\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\" disabled>\n\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t</button>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Presets\n\nProvides full support of [Presets](/docs/\\[framework]/tailwind-utilities/presets).\n\n```astro\n---\nimport { ArrowUpRightIcon } from \"lucide-react\";\n---\n\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled-brand\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled-brand\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal-brand\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined-brand\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<hr class=\"hr\" />\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled-primary-500\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled-primary-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal-primary\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined-primary-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button\n\t\t\ttype=\"button\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"btn-icon preset-filled-secondary-500\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Go\"\n\t\t\taria-label=\"Go\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled-secondary-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal-secondary\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined-secondary-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button\n\t\t\ttype=\"button\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"btn-icon preset-filled-tertiary-500\"\n\t\t\ttitle=\"Go\"\n\t\t\taria-label=\"Go\"\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled-tertiary-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal-tertiary\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined-tertiary-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled-success-500\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled-success-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal-success\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined-success-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled-warning-500\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled-warning-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal-warning\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined-warning-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled-error-500\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled-error-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal-error\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined-error-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-icon preset-filled-surface-500\" title=\"Go\" aria-label=\"Go\">\n\t\t\t<ArrowUpRightIcon size={16} />\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-filled-surface-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-tonal-surface\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn preset-outlined-surface-500\">\n\t\t\tButton\n\t\t</button>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Group\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n\tlet active = $state(\"january\");\n\tconst months = [\"january\", \"february\", \"march\"];\n</script>\n\n<nav class=\"btn-group preset-outlined-surface-200-800 flex-col md:flex-row\">\n\t{#each months as month (month)}\n\t\t<button\n\t\t\ttype=\"button\"\n\t\t\tclass=\"btn capitalize {month === active ? 'preset-filled' : 'preset-tonal'}\"\n\t\t\tonclick={() => (active = month)}\n\t\t>\n\t\t\t{month}\n\t\t</button>\n\t{/each}\n</nav>\n\n```\n",
